The '''Soul Cane''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

The Soul Cane is well known because of its combo potential and good stun, with its '''[Z] Soul Beam''' being a great stun, and essentially the identity of the sword.

However, it is hard to use due to its small hitboxes, which is why this sword is mostly seen in skill builds, usually paired with [[Acidum Rifle]] and other [[guns]].

==Obtainment==
The Soul Cane can be obtained after defeating the drill in the [[Magma Village]]'s [[Island Secrets|Secret Quest]] and talking to the [[Living Skeleton]]. It is recommended to use [[Fast Mode]] due to the entrance being hard to spot.

Prior to Update 30, Soul Cane has to be bought for {{Money|750,000}} from Living Skeleton.

